ginal","quote":"右丞相万彧被谴，忧死","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":426,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":3,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-ccb1ce3c80ed4611fc59","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-1d46e69138837f60a01e","layer":"original","quote":"以陆凯为左丞相〖10〗，常侍万彧为右丞相","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-4cccf48d27aa3aa2370b","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-a5c8966dcdf43d4ccc61","layer":"original","quote":"皓既践阼，加兴（侍郎）〔侍中〕，领青州牧。俄而彧谮兴、布追悔前事。十一月朔〖10〗，入朝，皓因收兴、布，徙广州〖11〗；道追杀之〖12〗，夷三族。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-89a7787cfa000c7b3131","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-2ba1972d4a8c96ace07e","layer":"original","quote":"七年七月〖8〗，休薨。左典军万彧，素与乌程侯孙皓善〖9〗，乃劝兴、布；于是兴、布废休嫡子而迎立皓","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":534,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-2f04ab6fa729f17fb52d","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-8fe95262eaec65905a52","layer":"original","quote":"与万彧同官，彧与皓有旧；俗士挟侵〖8〗，谓蕃自轻","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-5e574a309008fdcd5dc4","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：本传云丁忠使晋还，皓为大会，于会中杀蕃。检忠从北还，在此年之春；彧时尚未为丞相，至秋乃为相耳。《吴录》所言，为乖互不同。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-52d65d2e16edfb68507e","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-3a9b33fc8ece7eee5aaa","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓即位，与王蕃、郭逴、万彧俱为散骑中常侍。出为会稽太守。入为大司农。旧禁中主者，自用亲近人作之〖3〗。彧陈亲密近识，宜用好人；皓因敕有司〖4〗：求忠清之士，以应其选。遂用玄为宫下镇，禁中候〖5〗，主殿中事。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-6d1cf42f3fc6c1bcbe9e","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-3a9b33fc8ece7eee5aaa","layer":"original","quote":"彧陈亲密近识，宜用好人；皓因敕有司〖4〗：求忠清之士，以应其选。遂用玄为宫下镇，禁中候〖5〗，主殿中事","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-8eb1e6186b39a112b4ba","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》曰：“皓每于会，因酒酣，辄令侍臣嘲谑公卿，以为笑乐。万彧既为（左）〔右〕丞相，蕃嘲彧曰：‘鱼潜于渊，出水煦沫。何则？物有本性，不可横处非分也！彧出自溪谷，羊质虎皮；虚受光赫之宠，跨越三九之位。犬马犹能识养，将何以报厚施乎？’彧曰：‘唐虞之朝无谬举之才，造父之门无驽蹇之质；蕃上诬明选，下讪桢干：何伤于日月？适（多）见其不知量耳！’”","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":0,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
